<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The govern’ng vision of the Word</l><l>Is God Himself in Christ,</l><l>To work Himself into our being,</l><l>That He may be our life;</l><l>Our one accord is carried out</l><l>With one intent and way;</l><l>To love the Lord and know His life</l><l>In all we think and say.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The high peak of the vision is</l><l>The “diamond in the box;”</l><l>That God in Christ has made man God,</l><l>But in the Godhead, not;</l><l>Christ’s Body is expressed when God</l><l>And man in oneness meet;</l><l>The New Jerusalem is built,</l><l>The vision is complete!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
